# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Clickwright — .gitignore
# Organised by what generates the mess. If you add a new runtime
# output directory, register it under §5 so credentials and PII can
# never reach a commit.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1 · Secrets and environment ──────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit real keys, tokens or sign-in details. The example file
# stays tracked on purpose — it is the template everyone copies.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*.json
application_default_credentials.json
.gcloud/
.gac-credentials/

# Owner-only credential file written by app/governance/secrets.py
var/secrets.json
secrets.json

# ── 2 · Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version

# tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.pytype/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/

# packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
pip-wheel-metadata/
poetry.lock

# Jupyter, if someone explores locally
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── 3 · Node / frontend ──────────────────────────────────────────────
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
frontend/.vite/
frontend/vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# ── 4 · Browser automation leftovers ─────────────────────────────────
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
playwright/.cache/
*.webm
*.har

# Raw screen recordings of demo takes stay out of history; the trimmed
# GIF under docs/assets is the artefact we ship.
!/docs/assets/demo.gif

# ── 5 · Clickwright runtime data (var/) ──────────────────────────────
# Everything under var/ is produced at runtime and may contain PII,
# screenshots of internal systems, or resolved secrets:
#   var/registry/      compiled connectors
#   var/runs/          audit trails per run
#   var/artifacts/     step screenshots taken during exploration
#   var/approvals/     human-in-the-loop decisions
#   var/benchmarks/    measured explore-vs-replay numbers
#   var/bench/         full benchmark reports
#   var/secrets.json   local secret store (also pinned above)
var/

# ── 6 · Local assistant / tooling state ──────────────────────────────
.claude/
.impeccable/
.remember/
.continue/
.aider*

# ── 7 · Editors and IDEs ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.recommended.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# ── 8 · Operating systems ────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.directory
.fuse_hidden*

# ── 9 · Cloud SDKs and emulators ─────────────────────────────────────
firestore-data/
ui-FIRESTORE_EMULATOR.backup
.cloudstorage/
.gcloud-local/
firebase-debug.log

# ── 11 · Project planning docs (local only) ──────────────────────────
project.md
claude.md
idea.md

# ── 10 · Logs and scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
tmp/
.tmp/
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
core
core.*
